Hi Rachel,

I've created a branch that fixes this problem, at least for long data.frames (i.e., `long = TRUE`).  I'll try to get the pull request submitted soon, but for now you can install my copy of unmarked...

devtools::install_github("adamdsmith/unmarked", ref = "fix_csvumf")

Then your conversion will work:

library(unmarked)
